  "description": "The proposal comprises the retention and restoration of the existing historic front façade, demolition of the existing rear additions, and erection of a replacement building to provide one flexible Class E commercial unit at ground floor and four self-contained residential units on the upper floors. The development includes associated cycle parking, refuse and recycling storage, and all ancillary works. There is no change to the existing ground floor commercial use (Class E), with the upper floors providing new residential accommodation (Use Class C3).",
